{#
    One file on a page of its own: its facts, its preview and its public address (003-003-0002).

    IT IS A SECOND ROUTE ON THE SAME MOUNT, not a view of its own area — `AdminManager` declares
    why (ADR 0022). For this template that only matters in one place: every address it prints
    comes ready-made from `FileController`, the rule the listing follows for the same reason.

    THE WAY BACK IS ALWAYS THERE. It leads into the folder the file lies in, or to the listing
    root when it lies outside the folders — derived from the record and not from history, so it
    works for somebody who arrived from a bookmark.

    THE FOLDER LINE HAS THREE REASONS TO CARRY NO LINK, and they are asked in the plain order.
    That it is safe to ask `isRoot` first is `FileController`'s doing: without the right to read
    folders the core leaves the masked join empty, so a file inside a folder looks exactly like
    one outside them — and this page said „Ausserhalb der Ordner" about it until the controller
    stopped claiming `isRoot` without that right. A missing right takes an answer away
    (ADR 0019); it must not produce a different, wrong one. The rule lives there, in one place,
    and not a second time in this condition.

    THE PREVIEW IS EITHER AN IMAGE OR A LABEL, never an empty box — the listing's rule, and for
    its reason: a preview that failed to load and a file that was never going to have one must
    not look the same. `admin/file-preview` swaps a missing derivative for the original, because
    whether the configured alias exists cannot be found out from the package (Schema-Vertrag L25).

    THE DERIVATIVES ARE LISTED WITHOUT A `1x`/`2x` SEGMENT (003-003-0003). Measured: both default
    `ThumbnailSetting` rows carry `isResponsive = 0`, so those two addresses answer 500 — the form
    without the segment is the one ADR 0020 picked for the preview. `admin/file-variant` measures
    each entry in the browser and names the ones that did not arrive, because neither the
    existing aliases nor their nominal sizes are readable from the package (Schema-Vertrag L25).

    THE EMPTY LIST IS NOT AN ERROR AND DOES NOT LOOK LIKE ONE. Three different cases: the project
    configured no aliases — then the whole block is absent; the file is not one of the three
    derivable types — then one sentence says so; or an entry failed, which the module says at the
    entry. `FileController` decides which of the first two applies.

    THE METADATA FORM IS PART OF THIS PAGE (003-003-0004), and the alternative text sits at the
    same level as the title — not behind a disclosure. It is required for accessibility in every
    project that publishes the images, and what has to be unfolded first does not get filled in.

    A REFUSED SAVE COMES BACK AS THIS PAGE WITH THE TYPED VALUES STILL IN IT, and a finding goes
    to its field when the field is known, otherwise above the form — the two places and the single
    guess are `FormController`'s, and `FileController` decides which applies. A success leaves with
    a 303 instead, so a reload cannot write again; the sentence then arrives in the address and is
    shown by the report above.

    WITHOUT THE WRITE RIGHT THE FORM IS ABSENT and the three values are read as facts. Hiding it
    is tidiness — `saveMetadata()` refuses the post as well, which is the part that closes the
    data.

    THE PUBLIC ADDRESS IS STATED, AND SO IS WHAT IT MEANS. The core serves every stored file
    under this route without asking for a login (Schema-Vertrag L23). An editor who hands the
    address on should know that, and a page that shows the address while staying silent about it
    would be the worse of the two options.
#}{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}

{% block bodyAttributes %} class="admin"{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<main class="admin__main admin-file">
    <nav class="admin-files__trail" aria-label="Ordnerpfad">
        <a class="admin-files__trail-link" href="{{ rootUrl }}">Alle Dateien</a>
{% if folderUrl %}
        <span class="admin-files__trail-separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <a class="admin-files__trail-link" href="{{ folderUrl }}">{{ folderTitle }}</a>
{% endif %}
        <span class="admin-files__trail-separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span class="admin-files__trail-link admin-files__trail-link--current" aria-current="true">{{ name }}</span>
    </nav>

    <h1>{{ name }}</h1>

{% if report %}
    <p class="admin-files__report{{ report.ok ? ' admin-files__report--ok' : ' admin-files__report--problem' }}"
       role="status">{{ report.text }}</p>
{% endif %}
{% if error %}
    <p class="admin-form__error" role="alert">{{ error }}</p>
{% endif %}

    <div class="admin-file__layout">
        <div class="admin-file__preview-box">
{% if preview %}
            <img class="admin-file__preview" src="{{ preview }}" alt=""
                 decoding="async"
                 data-controller="admin-file-preview"
                 data-admin-file-preview-fallback-value="{{ original }}">
{% else %}
            <span class="admin-file__preview admin-file__preview--badge"
                  role="img" aria-label="{{ type }}">{{ badge }}</span>
{% endif %}
        </div>

        <dl class="admin-file__facts">
            <dt class="admin-file__term">Name</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">{{ name }}</dd>

            <dt class="admin-file__term">Ordner</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">
{% if folderUrl %}
                <a href="{{ folderUrl }}">{{ folderTitle }}</a>
{% elseif isRoot %}
                Ausserhalb der Ordner
{% elseif not mayReadFolders %}
                <span class="admin-file__muted">Nicht einsehbar — es fehlt das Recht, Ordner zu lesen.</span>
{% else %}
                <span class="admin-file__muted">Der Ordner ist nicht mehr vorhanden.</span>
{% endif %}
            </dd>

            <dt class="admin-file__term">Typ</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">{{ type }}</dd>

            <dt class="admin-file__term">Größe</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">{{ size }}</dd>

            <dt class="admin-file__term">Hochgeladen</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">{{ created }}</dd>

            <dt class="admin-file__term">Adresse der Datei</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">
                <a class="admin-file__address" href="{{ original }}">{{ original }}</a>
                <span class="admin-file__muted">Diese Adresse ist ohne Anmeldung abrufbar.</span>
            </dd>
        </dl>
    </div>

    <section class="admin-file__meta" aria-labelledby="admin-file-meta">
        <h2 class="admin-file__meta-heading" id="admin-file-meta">Angaben zur Datei</h2>
{% if mayWrite %}
        <form class="admin-file__meta-form" method="post" action="{{ formUrl }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="{{ tokenField }}" value="{{ token }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="{{ actionField }}" value="{{ metadata }}">
{% for field in fields %}
{% set described = field.error ? 'error-' ~ field.property : '' %}
            <div class="admin-form__field{% if field.error %} admin-form__field--invalid{% endif %}">
                <label class="admin-form__label" for="field-{{ field.property }}">{{ field.label }}</label>
                <input class="admin-form__control" type="text" id="field-{{ field.property }}"
                       name="{{ field.property }}" value="{{ field.value }}"
                       maxlength="{{ field.maxlength }}"
{%- if field.property == 'altText' %} aria-describedby="hint-altText{% if field.error %} {{ described }}{% endif %}"
{%- elseif field.error %} aria-describedby="{{ described }}"
{%- endif %}{% if field.error %} aria-invalid="true"{% endif %}>
{% if field.property == 'altText' %}
                <p class="admin-form__hint" id="hint-altText">Beschreibt, was auf dem Bild zu sehen ist — für Menschen, die es nicht sehen können, und für Suchmaschinen. Keine Wiederholung des Titels.</p>
{% endif %}
{% if field.error %}
                <p class="admin-form__field-error" id="{{ described }}">{{ field.error }}</p>
{% endif %}
            </div>
{% endfor %}
            <button class="admin-files__action-button" type="submit">Angaben speichern</button>
        </form>
{% else %}
        <dl class="admin-file__facts">
{% for field in fields %}
            <dt class="admin-file__term">{{ field.label }}</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">{{ field.value != '' ? field.value : '—' }}</dd>
{% endfor %}
        </dl>
        <p class="admin-form__hint" role="status">Du darfst diese Angaben ansehen, aber nicht ändern.</p>
{% endif %}
    </section>

{% if hasAliases %}
    <section class="admin-file__variants" aria-labelledby="admin-file-variants">
        <h2 class="admin-file__variants-heading" id="admin-file-variants">Verkleinerte Fassungen</h2>
{% if not isThumbnailable %}
        <p class="admin-files__empty">
            Für diesen Dateityp entstehen keine verkleinerten Fassungen — die gibt es nur für
            JPEG, GIF und PNG.
        </p>
{% else %}
        <ul class="admin-file__variant-list">
{% for variant in variants %}
            <li class="admin-file__variant" data-controller="admin-file-variant">
                <a class="admin-file__variant-link" href="{{ variant.url }}">
                    <img class="admin-file__variant-image" src="{{ variant.url }}" alt=""
                         decoding="async" data-admin-file-variant-target="image">
                </a>
                <span class="admin-file__variant-alias">{{ variant.alias }}</span>
                <span class="admin-file__variant-size" data-admin-file-variant-target="size" hidden></span>
                <span class="admin-file__variant-missing" data-admin-file-variant-target="missing" hidden>
                    Diese Fassung gibt es in dieser Installation nicht.
                </span>
            </li>
{% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p class="admin-file__variants-note">
            Diese Adressen sind ebenfalls ohne Anmeldung abrufbar. Die verkleinerte Fassung
            entsteht beim ersten Abruf, falls sie noch fehlt — bei mehreren Fassungen also
            mehrere Verkleinerungen auf einmal.
        </p>
{% endif %}
    </section>
{% endif %}
</main>
{% endblock %}
